# Board binding for this repository (read by .agents/skills/github-projects).
# Committed; the gateway credentials live in .env.local, which is not.
#
# semantic-cms has no ProjectsV2 board yet. Create one, then fill these in and
# add its number to the gateway's ACP_PROJECT_ALLOWLIST:
#
#   gh project create --owner zachshallbetter --title "semantic-cms — <name>"
#
# GH_PROJECT_OWNER=zachshallbetter
# GH_PROJECT_NUMBER=
#
# The reconcile-project / operate-frontier skills in this repo assume a board
# with a workflow field and an `Agent` text field; name them here once it
# exists (GP_FIELD_STATUS, GP_STATUS_*, GP_FIELD_AGENT).
